      "clearinghouse_direction": "One provider connection to multiple insurers while preserving insurer-specific products, benefits, tariffs, authorization rules, claims rules and settlement rules."
    },
    "claude_instruction": "Use this JSON as the authoritative implementation specification for the OpesInsure Provider Portal. Add or repair existing code rather than rewriting completed platform modules. Preserve existing API contracts, tenant isolation, insurance business logic, maker-checker controls, audit evidence and document immutability. Do not invent insurer tariffs, benefit rules, negotiated prices, legal deadlines, authorization rules or provider contracts. Unknown insurer/provider values must remain CONFIG_REQUIRED or PENDING_PRIVATE_SOURCE. No financial balance may be editable directly; all balances derive from posted transactions."
  },
